Subject: [PATCH 4/8] fix(plugins): build the query map with Object.fromEntries

The null-prototype map still wrote each key with `out[key] = value`, which is
the dynamic property write CodeQL objects to, guard or no guard.
`Object.fromEntries` defines each key as an own data property instead of going
through a setter, so there is no write for a caller-chosen name to reach.

